# 统一换行：源码 LF，Windows 脚本 CRLF。
# 目的：避免手册记录的「上游 diff 全是误报（本地 CRLF）」问题。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制，禁止行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.onnx binary
*.ort binary
*.gguf binary
*.bin binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ttc binary
*.woff2 binary
